docs {
  # Batch Download ZIP Stream

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/download`
  **Auth:** None (Public)

  ## Description

  Streams a compressed `.zip` archive on the fly containing all requested attachments. The server streams files directly from RustFS into the zip stream without accumulating the whole archive in server RAM.

  ## Request

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `ids` | `int64[]` | Yes | List of attachment IDs to package into ZIP |
  | `archive_name` | `string` | No | Custom zip file name (default: `attachments_archive.zip`) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  Binary zip archive stream (`Content-Type: application/zip`).
}
